  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1806.01 Road Skills Examination: Description",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1806.01 Road Skills Examination: Description.\n\n(a) Prior to scheduling a road skills examination, all new applicants who did not hold a CDL prior to February 7, 2022, or do not meet exemption requirements under 49 CFR Part 383 shall complete Entry-level Driver Training Requirements, pursuant to RSA 259:26, II and 49 CFR 380.600 et. seq.\n\n(b) The road skills examination shall consist of the following in the order reflected:\n\n(1) Vehicle inspection;\n\n(2) Basic control skills test; and\n\n(3) Road test.\n\n(c) Information on the Road Skills test shall be available at https://www.dmv.nh.gov/drivers-licensenon-driver-ids/commercial-driver-licenses.\n\nSource. #4901, eff 8-3-90; ss by #6298, INTERIM, eff 8-3-96, EXPIRES: 12-1-96; ss by #6338, eff 9-25-96; ss by #8182, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRED: 3-24-05\n\nNew. #8405, eff 8-2-05, (formerly Saf-C 1803.06); ss by #10523, eff 2-18-14, EXPIRED: 2-18-24\n\nNew. #13963, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 5-13-24; ss by #14100, eff 10-18-24, EXPIRES: 10-18-34",
